\\,{Q}^{T}b.\n$$\n\nThen, since ${R}^{T}$ is invertible, pre-multiplying by $({R}^{T})^{-1}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({R}^{T})^{-1}\\cdot {R}^{T}Rx & =({R}^{T})^{-1}\\cdot {R}^{T}{Q}^{T}b \\\\ Rx & ={Q}^{T}b\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $R$ is invertible, pre-multiplying by ${R}^{-1}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}^{-1}\\cdot Rx & ={R}^{-1}\\cdot {Q}^{T}b \\\\ x & =\\bbox[6px,border: 1px solid black]{\\,\\phantom{|}\\,\\,{R}^{-1}\\,}\\,{Q}^{T}\\,b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing parts of the equation are ${R}^{-1}$ and ${Q}^{T}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401099 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401100 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401101 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401102 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401103 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186401099 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401098 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "3d1a3359-653b-5fbe-99d8-82db0139d073" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401099 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}^{-1}$ and ${Q}^{T}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401099 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401099 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0fdcd9d7-d7a2-5fbc-b814-a5cdbab0aba9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401100 #edb/ref 1080 "${R}^{-1}$ and $Q$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401100 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401100 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9ac28ba0-e324-56db-ad83-179ae52ae559" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401101 #edb/ref 1080 "$Q$ and $R$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401101 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401101 #edb/ref 10